  "body": "Vendors' instructions are crystal clear: this property must be sold! 624 Whangaparaoa Road is perfect for families looking to get a foot on the Hibiscus Coast ladder, with space to run and play, while land banking in this fast growing suburb. Just down the road from New World and the upcoming Penlink!\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------\r\nMove-In Ready for Families!\r\n------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nAll the hard yards on the interior is already done. Move straight in and enjoy a home that has been freshly painted with new carpets underfoot. The open-plan living area features character high-pitched ceilings and a brand-new kitchen that forms the hub of the home. The bathroom has also been refreshed, elevating the overall feel of the room. When the weekend rolls around, slide open the doors to the covered deck-an epic spot for a classic Kiwi barbie. \r\n\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\nMassive Section for Keen-Eyed Visionaries\r\n--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nSitting on a huge slice of land, the upside here is massive. There is brilliant potential to add 1 or more minor dwellings to generate extra income or house extended family. A standalone lock-up garage offers brilliant secure space for the tools, boards, or weekend toys. \r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------\r\nThe Ultimate Stanmore Bay Spot\r\n-------------------------------------------------\r\n \r\nPositioned incredibly close to stunning local beaches, you've got the best of the coast just a short drive away.\r\n\r\n* Schools: In zone for the highly sought-after Stanmore Bay School and Whangaparaoa College.\r\n\r\n* Transport: Commuting is easy with buses stopping right on Whangaparaoa Rd, plus quick access to the Hibiscus Coast Park & Ride and Gulf Harbour ferry.\r\n\r\n* Amenities: You're just minutes from Coast Plaza, local supermarkets, the Stanmore Bay Leisure Centre, and awesome coastal parks.\r\n\r\n\r\nALL CONJUNCTIONALS WELCOME, so agents, bring your buyers! \r\n\r\nContact Ian 0211592078 today to find out more!",
